      "interpretation": "Invalid physical formatter result raises RuntimeError before cause mapping. Parent-stop accesses required cause keys; reset-leg maps each value and only datetime instances are formatted, other values unchanged. Unknown kinds are omitted. Missing box-source timestamps use null, whereas missing box prices are passed to native string conversion (not emitted as JSON null). The cause event time is formatted as recorded; stop proof is taken from the physical projection.",
